        {
          "id": "blk_s7hm7h69ms",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2,
                    "preset": "h3"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Together, we can"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_wkfdwbeb20",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Cultivate the infrastructure of the next civilization.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I support coalitions, communities, and projects in identifying leverage points, architecting protocols, and forming synergistic alliances. From DAO ecosystems to bioregional networks, we’ll build coherence around shared purpose and design for emergence, not control."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Shape stories that shape systems.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We live inside the stories we tell. I work with communities, coalitions, and visionary teams to surface and shape narratives that remember our interconnectedness and regenerate shared meaning. Through co-creative media, mythic framing, and cultural design, we cultivate cultures of wholeness—where values, voices, and visions can harmonize toward collective liberation."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Create the conditions for emergence and transformation.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I offer consulting in participatory process design and facilitation architecture for groups navigating complexity. Whether you’re prototyping a new governance model, hosting multi-stakeholder dialogue, or cultivating a living commons, I support you in weaving regenerative principles into the structure of your collaboration. Together, we co-design the scaffolding for trust, coherence, and transformation."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Align mycelial networks for systemic impact.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "I work with networks, protocols, and civic initiatives to identify synergies, clarify roles, and cohere shared direction. Using a systems view, I help map the unique function of each node within a broader ecology—so your efforts land in the right place, at the right time, with the right collaborators. Whether you’re navigating bioregional alliances, Web3 ecosystems, or civic coalitions, I support the strategic scaffolding that allows distributed efforts to harmonize and scale."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
